{"articleNo":"539263","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=539263&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교내행사] [공학][2025.10.22.(금) 2025 대한민국 미래모빌리티엑스포 견학 안내]","writer":"공학교육혁신센터","writeDate":"2025.10.15","hit":"2949","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, 돋움, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">[2025.10.22.(금)&nbsp; 2025 대한민국 미래모빌리티엑스포&nbsp;견학&nbsp;안내]</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, 돋움, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">견학일정: 2025년 10월 22일 (수)</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, 돋움, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">견학장소: 대구 엑스코</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, 돋움, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">견학분야: 친환경모빌리티, 미래모빌리티, 이차전지 및 부품&amp;서비스</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, 돋움, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">모집인원: 본교 재학생 20명 (졸업생, 유예생, 대학원생은 신청 불가)</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, 돋움, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">신청방법: 10월 16일(목)까지 BISKIT을 통해 신청(선착순 20명 신청 시 조기마감)</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, 돋움, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">집합장소 및 시간: 본교 공동실험실습관 앞, 13시30분출발 (10분 전까지 도착)</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, 돋움, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); word-break: break-all;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, 돋움, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); word-break: break-all;\">&nbsp;</p><table style=\"width: 839.5px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, 돋움, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\"><tbody><tr class=\"first\"><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"first\" style=\"padding: 16px 15px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, AppleSDGothicNeo, Dotum, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, arial, sans-serif; overflow-wrap: break-word; line-height: 1.2em; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(225, 229, 230); border-right: 1px solid rgb(225, 229, 230); border-left: none; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; width: 209px; height: 30px;\"><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">교육일정</p></td><td class=\"last\" style=\"padding: 16px 15px; font-family: