ottom: 1em; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">14:30~16:30</p></td><td class=\"last\" style=\"padding: 16px 15px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, AppleSDGothicNeo, Dotum, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, arial, sans-serif; overflow-wrap: break-word; line-height: 1.2em; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(225, 229, 230); border-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid rgb(225, 229, 230); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; width: 390px; height: 205px;\"><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">&lt;2시간 자유 관람&gt;</p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">• 친환경 모빌리티</p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">전기자동차, 수소자동차, 하이브리드 자동차</p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">• 미래 모빌리티</p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">도심항공교통(UAM), 자율주행자동차</p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">자율주행 AI, 센서, 통신기술</p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">• 이차전지 및 부품·서비스</p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">배터리 소재·부품·장비 및 배터리팩</p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">리사이클링 기술, 충전 인프라</p></td></tr><tr class=\"last\"><td class=\"first\" style=\"padding: 16px 15px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, AppleSDGothicNeo, Dotum, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, arial, sans-serif; overflow-wrap: break-word; line-height: 1.2em; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(225, 229, 230); border-right: 1px solid rgb(225, 229, 230); border-left: none; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; width: 109px; height: 41px;\"><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">16:30~17:30</p></td><td class=\"last\" style=\"padding: 16px 15px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, AppleSDGothicNeo, Dotum, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, arial, sans-serif; overflow-wrap: break-word; line-height: 1.2em; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(225, 229, 230); border-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid rgb(225, 229, 230); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; width: 390px; height: 41px;\"><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">• 이동 (대구 엑스코 → 구미)</p></td></tr></tbody></table><div data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"23027\" id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, 돋움, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); word-break: break-all;\"><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\">* 선착순 선발<br>*&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\">신청 인원이 많을 경우 조기 마감될 수 있으며, 신청 인원이 미달될 경우 견학은 취소될 수 있습니다.</span><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><br>*&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">수업 공결 불가능, 중식 미제공</span><br>* 일정 및 내용은 프로그램 진행에 따라 변동될 수 있음</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\">* 일정 종료 후<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;설문지를 작성</span>한 뒤, 학교행 버스를 탑승하거나 자유롭게 귀가하시면 됩니다.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\">(자유일정 종료 후 설문지 미작성하시면 미수료 처리됩니다.)&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\">&lt;문의: 공학교육혁신센터&gt;<br>전화: 054-478-7952<br>이메일: b00738@kumoh.ac.kr</span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
